{"term":"devil","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:1cba4688a5a67d0b8b","definition":"The chief devil; Satan.","example":"","pos":"name","synonyms":["Aduwallah","Adversary","Al-Shaytaan","Antichrist","archfiend","Ash-Shaytan","Azazel","Beast","Beelzebub","bogey","cosmocrat","deceiver","deuce","Devil","diablo","Diabolus","dickens","Dragon","Enemy","Evil One","Father of Lies","Gog","Iblis","Jack Ketch","leviathan","lord of the flies","Lucifer","Mephistopheles","Old Gentleman","Old Hairy","Old Harry","Old Nick","Old One","Old Scratch","Old Serpent","Prince of Darkness","Prince of Demons","Prince of Evil","Sam Scratch","Satan","Serpent","shaitan","Son of the Dawn"],"antonyms":["God"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":[],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/devil#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:d85296500ec8c75978","definition":"An evil creature, the objectification of a hostile and destructive force.","example":"","pos":"noun","synonyms":["demon"],"antonyms":["angel","god"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["diabolo","diablo"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/devil#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:8401cf65407f5fce8d","definition":"A man with red or orange skin and a pair of horns on his head, a pointed goatee, and a long tail, who carries a pitchfork, represents evil, and is portrayed to children as a boogeyman who punishes bad behavior.","example":"","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["diabolo","diablo"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/devil#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:a4c16ce89d03541c1c","definition":"The bad part of the conscience; the opposite to the angel.","example":"The devil in me wants to let him suffer.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":["angel","conscience"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["diabolo","diablo"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/devil#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:d42a2862612403e45e","definition":"A wicked or naughty person, or one who harbors reckless, spirited energy, especially in a mischievous way; usually said of a young child.","example":"Those two kids are devils in a toy store.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["imp","rascal","scamp","scoundrel"],"antonyms":["angel","saint"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["diabolo","diablo"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/devil#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:8d2ba7de3c049c336e","definition":"A thing that is awkward or difficult to understand or do.","example":"That math problem was a devil.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["bastard","bitch","bugger","stinker"],"antonyms":["cakewalk","piece of cake"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["diabolo","diablo"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/devil#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:d6cd14a6f640536c74","definition":"Hell.","example":"What in the devil is that?","pos":"noun","synonyms":["deuce","dickens","fuck","heck","hell"],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"euphemistic","register":"euphemistic","wordFamily":["diabolo","diablo"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/devil#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:b937b57589fe43b92f","definitio